ming families and mixed-skill groups."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"case-label","children":"02 / MY CONTRIBUTION"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Created the original game concept and cooperative design pillars.",{"children":"Created the original game concept and cooperative design pillars."}],["$","li","Directed game design, visual style, tone, characters, and presentation.",{"children":"Directed game design, visual style, tone, characters, and presentation."}],["$","li","Designed rescue interactions and combination attacks that reward cooperation.",{"children":"Designed rescue interactions and combination attacks that reward cooperation."}],["$","li","Used narrative context and clear character roles to make a traditionally hardcore genre easier to understand.",{"children":"Used narrative context and clear character roles to make a traditionally hardcore genre easier to understand."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"case-label","children":"03 / DESIGN DETAILS"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"detail-grid","children":[["$","article","Cooperative structure",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Cooperative structure"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Four players share the screen and support one another through rescues, coordinated positioning, and combination attacks. Team success matters more than individual score chasing."}]]}],["$","article","Readable roles",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Readable roles"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Distinct characters, silhouettes, colors, and abilities help players understand their place in the group quickly—even when the screen becomes busy."}]]}],["$","article","Accessible tone",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Accessible tone"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The animal cast and playful presentation broaden the audience without removing the mechanical depth expected from the genre."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"outcome","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"case-label","children":"04 / OUTCOME"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"B.ARK shipped on Nintendo Switch and PC and was featured in Nintendo’s Indie World Showcase."}]]}]]}]]}],"$L7","$L8"]}]
